CRIRSCO. International Reporting Template, June 2024, 79 PDF pages. [Official template](https://crirsco.com/wp-content/uploads/woocommerce_uploads/2024/06/CRIRSCO_International_Reporting_Template_June2024_Update_Approved_for_Release_20240627-dl8515.pdf). Brazilian Commission for Resources and Reserves, CBRR, 2022 guide: [Portuguese edition](https://crirsco.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/BRAZIL-CBRR-2022-Portuguese.pdf) · [Official catalogue and English alternative](https://crirsco.com/documentation/cbrr/).

Read the complete identified template/guide during advanced evaluation, including definitions, modifying factors, technical studies, evidence, and reporting scope. The template explicitly distinguishes its advisory/code-development role from applicable national/regional codes. Do not infer an operating reserve from a toy block model or geological occurrence alone.

Official versions, access, scope, and copyright were checked on 29 October 2026. The template retains ©2024 CRIRSCO, all rights reserved. Preserve actual national/edition requirements and component notices. Documents stay external; no claim of regulatory compliance is made by a learning exercise.

